# SW360 client test fixtures must keep LF line endings on every platform.
# These files are hashed by tests, and the expected checksums are computed
# against LF content (matching Linux, which is where the majority of builds
# and CI runs happen). Do not let any platform-specific autocrlf settings
# rewrite them to CRLF.
* -text
*.json text eol=lf
